- [ ] Implement Content Security Policy headers
- [ ] Add authentication/authorization
- [ ] Implement audit logging
- [ ] Add API versioning
- [ ] Document security headers
- [ ] Set up monitoring and alerting

---

## 📦 Required Dependencies

```json
