### 6️⃣ Parameter Pollution Attack

**BEFORE:**
```javascript
// VULNERABLE - No validation
app.get('/users', (req, res) => {
  // Accepts any query parameters
  res.json(users);
});

// Attack: Unknown behavior with unexpected params
GET /users?limit=10&limit=999&offset=-1&inject=true&admin=yes

// Behavior undefined - might have security implications
```

**AFTER:**
```javascript
// SAFE - Whitelist validation
app.get('/users', (req, res) => {
  const allowedParams = ['limit', 'offset', 'role'];

  // Reject unexpected parameters
  Object.keys(req.query).forEach((key) => {
    if (!allowedParams.includes(key)) {
      throw new Error(`Unexpected parameter: ${key}`);
    }
  });
});

// Attack attempt:
GET /users?limit=10&limit=999&offset=-1&inject=true&admin=yes

// Response:
400 Bad Request

{
  "error": "Invalid query parameters",
  "details": {
    "inject": "Unexpected parameter: inject",
    "admin": "Unexpected parameter: admin"
  }
}

// All injection attempts rejected
```

