# Quick Reference Guide

## Security Issues Found - Quick Summary

| Issue | Severity | Fix | Impact |
|-------|----------|-----|--------|
| No Authentication | 🔴 Critical | Add API Key validation | Unauthorized access |
| No Input Validation | 🔴 Critical | Use express-validator | SQL injection, XSS |
| No Error Handling | 🔴 Critical | Add try-catch + middleware | App crashes, info leak |
| Exposed Sensitive Data | 🔴 Critical | Require auth on /users | Data breach |
| No Security Headers | 🟠 High | Add helmet.js | Clickjacking, MIME sniffing |
| No Rate Limiting | 🟠 High | Add express-rate-limit | DoS attacks |
| No Request Timeout | 🟠 High | Add timeout middleware | Resource exhaustion |
| No Request Size Limits | 🟠 High | Add body parser limits | Memory DoS |
| No Logging | 🟠 High | Add morgan | Can't detect attacks |
| No CORS | 🟡 Medium | Add cors package | Unauthorized requests |
| Hard-coded Config | 🟡 Medium | Use environment vars | Secrets in code |

