npm audit
npm install --save-dev snyk
snyk test

# Test rate limiting
npm install --save-dev loadtest
loadtest -c 100 -t 10 http://localhost:3000/health

# Test input validation
curl "http://localhost:3000/users?name=<script>alert('xss')</script>"
```

---

## Security Checklist

- [ ] Input validation on all endpoints
- [ ] Centralized error handling
- [ ] Helmet.js installed and configured
