- [x] Easy to add authentication
- [x] Easy to add authorization
- [x] Database agnostic
- [x] Testable endpoints

---

## 🔒 Security Best Practices Checklist

### Input Validation
- [x] Validate all inputs (query, params, body)
- [x] Use strict type checking
- [x] Implement length constraints
- [x] Validate email format
- [x] Sanitize user inputs
- [x] Validate numeric ranges
